      "field": "uncertainty",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "entailed",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC12348563::web::021::3_4_microstructure_and_chemical_composit",
        "PMC12348563::web::031::4_conclusions"
      ],
      "same_system": "yes"
    },
    {
      "text": "Al2O3 passivates the alloy surface and limits inward oxygen diffusion.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "entailed",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC12348563::web::021::3_4_microstructure_and_chemical_composit"
      ],
      "same_system": "yes"
    },
    {
      "text": "Growth and merging of Al2O3 and Cr2O3 contribute to the high-temperature oxidation resistance of FeNiCuAlCr.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "entailed",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC12348563::web::021::3_4_microstructure_and_chemical_composit",
        "PMC12348563::web::031::4_conclusions"
      ],
      "same_system": "yes"
    },
    {
      "text": "A dense Al2O3-Cr2O3 film inhibits corrosion in 3.5% NaCl.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC12348563::web::031::4_conclusions"
      ],
      "same_system": "yes"
    },
    {
      "text": "FeNiCuAlCr has a corrosion potential of -0.21 V and a corrosion current density of 45.7 μA/cm2 in 3.5% NaCl.",
      "field": "uncertainty",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "entailed",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC12348563::web::031::4_conclusions"
      ],
      "same_system": "yes"
    },
    {
      "text": "Tailoring oxide-forming elements also refines the alloy grain structure.",
      "field": "structural_mediator",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "A refined grain structure increases dislocation resistance and thereby raises hardness or strength.",
      "field": "structural_mediator",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The baseline alloy has a coarser microstructure because it lacks a tailored ratio of oxide-forming elements.",
      "field": "baseline",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The baseline alloy forms less uniform oxide layers and consequently has poorer oxidation resistance.",
